_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Ensure path normalization for MDX redirects**

The constructed path might have issues with double slashes or missing slashes when combining directory and name. Consider using `path.join` and ensuring the path starts with a forward slash.

```diff
-const toPath = `/${node.parent.relativeDirectory}${node.parent.name === 'index' ? '' : `/${node.parent.name}`}`;
+const pathParts = [node.parent.relativeDirectory];
+if (node.parent.name !== 'index') {
+  pathParts.push(node.parent.name);
+}
+const toPath = '/' + pathParts.filter(Boolean).join('/');
```


